	(text "FIT ONE" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 124.46 52.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7) bold (color 140 0 190 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b296ce64-0ba9-4c3b-acb8-614ee25c2604"))
	(text_box "TPS61240 is a fixed 5.0 V boost. The inductor must be 1.0 uH or more (L5, saturation current above 0.9 A). CIN (C22) is 2.2 uF. COUT (C23) must keep at least 2.7 uF effective at 5 V, so a 10 uF 10 V part is used. Keep CIN and COUT close to the pins." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 35.56 0) (size 82 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "605c57e4-b8df-45e7-b99c-3d1f53b561e8"))
	(text_box "EN needs only 1.0 V, so the 1.8 V logic level from the processor is enough. R11 holds EN low while the processor pins float after reset (nRF54L15 errata 103)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 48.76 0) (size 82 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8efe770e-df0c-46b8-8fd8-866af6b06311"))
	(text_box "VLED has two possible sources. R12 (boost, fitted) is the default. R13 (VSYS direct, not fitted) is power tree option A for comparison. Fit only one of the two. The PWR_FLAG tells ERC that VLED is driven." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 59.96 0) (size 82 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4bde8ff0-43bd-42cc-92ec-78a60a29b384"))
	(text_box "Option A check: VLED must stay inside 3.1 to 5.5 V. The green LED needs its forward voltage (2.8 V max at 20 mA) plus about 0.9 V driver headroom, so about 3.7 V: with a 3.0 to 4.2 V cell the green channel drops out at the bottom of the discharge. Red and IR work down to about 3.1 V. The boost (R12) has no such limit." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 111.76 0) (size 100 10.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4e003950-85fc-46ea-ae36-981efb006542"))
